B.Mv=new A.bn(B.l9,["ecotwin.local oder 192.168.188.x","Status","Daten","Bus","Register","Config","Anlage OK","St\xf6rung","Bus stumm","Warten","Warte auf Daten","Kein Telegramm empfangen","Noch kein Telegramm vom Bus empfangen","{n} Telegramme gelesen, Bus aktiv","{n} aktive St\xf6rungen","1 aktive St\xf6rung","Die W\xe4rmepumpe meldet eine St\xf6rung","Bus stumm seit {t}","M\xf6glicher Defekt, oder das Kabel hat sich gel\xf6st","A/B, Versorgung des Transceivers und RO an GPIO16 pr\xfcfen","Ger\xe4t nicht erreichbar","Pr\xfcfen, ob es eingeschaltet und im selben Netz ist","Hydraulikmodul GS \xb7 R410A","Vorlauf","R\xfccklauf","Warmwasser","Au\xdfen","Mittel 24 h {v}","K\xe4ltekreis","Bildet die Info-Seite des Bedienteils nach (Handbuch Kap. 4.2): gleiche Anordnung, gleiche K\xfcrzel, gleiche Bauteile. Die Werte stammen aus den auf dem Bus gelesenen Registern.","Au\xdfenluft","L\xfcfter 1","L\xfcfter 2","Standby","Heizen","K\xfchlen","ein","aus","Verdichter","Frequenz","Expansionsventil","Abtauung","W\xe4rmeleistung","COP","Diagnose","Verdampfung","Verfl\xfcssigung","\xdcberhitzung","Unterk\xfchlung","\u0394T Wasser","Erwartet bei diesen Bedingungen","Wirkungsgrad","K\xe4ltemittelf\xfcllung","F\xfcllmenge plausibel korrekt","M\xf6glicherweise zu wenig K\xe4ltemittel","M\xf6glicherweise zu viel K\xe4ltemittel","Kein eindeutiges Bild","guter Wirkungsgrad","mittlerer Wirkungsgrad","niedriger Wirkungsgrad","unvollst\xe4ndig","nicht bewertbar","Warte auf Betriebsdaten.","Verdichter steht: nichts zu bewerten.","Abtauung l\xe4uft: die Messwerte sind nicht aussagekr\xe4ftig.","Bewertung nur im Heizbetrieb m\xf6glich. Beim K\xfchlen liegt die Fl\xfcssigkeitsleitung auf der anderen Kreisseite.","Hinweise, keine Diagnose. Gelten nur, wenn die Maschine seit einigen Minuten eingeschwungen l\xe4uft. Die Grenzwerte sind allgemein f\xfcr R410A, nicht aus dem Handbuch dieser Maschine, und die Dr\xfccke werden als Absolutdruck gelesen: eine noch zu pr\xfcfende Annahme. Deutet das Bild auf eine auff\xe4llige F\xfcllmenge hin, von einer Fachkraft messen lassen: es ist kein Nachweis eines Lecks.","Legende der K\xfcrzel","Wasseraustritt, Vorlauf","Wassereintritt, R\xfccklauf","Fl\xfcssigkeitsleitung","Saugdruck, Niederdruck","Sauggastemperatur","Verfl\xfcssigungsdruck, Hochdruck","Hei\xdfgastemperatur","Au\xdfenw\xe4rmetauscher","\xd6ffnung des Expansionsventils","Au\xdfenluft","L\xfcfterdrehzahl","Frequenz und Strom des Verdichters","Die K\xfcrzel sind die des Bedienteils. Die beiden mit ? markierten sind vermutete Zuordnungen, auf dem Bus noch nicht best\xe4tigt.","Warte auf die Betriebsregister.\nDer Sniffer sieht sie nur, wenn das Bedienteil sie abfragt.","Temperaturen","Kreislauf","Elektrisch","Leistung","Versionen","Telegramme","{n} Byte","CRC-Fehler","{n} g\xfcltig","Busstille","Laufzeit","Slaves am Bus","Kein Slave am Bus gesehen.","Rohtelegramme","Kein Telegramm erfasst.","Adr.","Anfr.","Antw.","Ausn.","Reg.","Alter","Adresse {n}","Anfrage","Antwort","Ausnahme","Schreiben","CRC falsch","Zuordnung Index \u2192 Register","Auswertung noch nicht verf\xfcgbar.","Laut Herstellerprotokoll ist das Register eines Parameters der Datenbankindex plus eins, hier wird also Offset 1, flaches Modell erwartet. Kommt etwas anderes heraus, folgt die Maschine diesem Dokument nicht und der Maschine ist zu glauben.","Zu wenige Register f\xfcr einen belastbaren Vergleich.","Erkannter Offset: {off} ({modello}). Register des Parameters N = {off} + N.","Kein \xfcberzeugender Offset: es braucht mehr Register, oder die Zuordnung folgt dem Dokument nicht.","flaches Modell","variable Breite","Register","Nur ver\xe4nderliche","Aktualisieren","Kein Register f\xfcr diesen Slave.","Slave {n}","{n} Register","Reg","Par.","Wert","Min","Max","Offset","Modell","Punkte","von","Ger\xe4t","Firmware","IP-Adresse","WLAN","Freier Speicher","Laufzeit","Netzwerk","Verbundenes Netz","Modus","Access Point","Heimnetz","Netz wechseln","Neustart","Die Zugangsdaten liegen im nichtfl\xfcchtigen Speicher des Chips und \xfcberstehen Firmware-Updates. Antwortet das Netz beim Start nicht, \xf6ffnet das Ger\xe4t den Access Point ECOTWIN_Sniffer und der Sniffer l\xe4uft trotzdem weiter.","RS485-Bus","Parameter","Senden","deaktiviert","Pin RX","Pin TX","keiner",'Das Ger\xe4t sendet nur, um die acht Parameter der Karte oben zu schreiben, nur auf ausdr\xfcckliche Anfrage und erst nach einer gemessenen Buspause: siehe "Anlagenparameter". F\xfcr alles andere bleibt es reiner Empf\xe4nger. Kommen alle Telegramme mit CRC-Fehler an, ist der erste Versuch die Umstellung auf 8N1.',"Verbindung","Ger\xe4teadresse \xe4ndern","Wartung","Erfasste Daten l\xf6schen","L\xf6scht die Registertabelle, die Statistiken und das Telegrammprotokoll auf dem Ger\xe4t. Die Konfiguration bleibt unber\xfchrt und es wird nicht auf den Bus geschrieben.","Sprache","Daten l\xf6schen?","Register, Statistiken und bisher erfasste Telegramme werden vom Ger\xe4t gel\xf6scht. Der Vorgang l\xe4sst sich nicht r\xfcckg\xe4ngig machen.","Ger\xe4t neu starten?","Der Sniffer beginnt von vorn: die bisher gesammelten Statistiken gehen verloren. Der Bus wird nicht angetastet.","Abbrechen","Daten gel\xf6scht","L\xf6schen fehlgeschlagen","Aktive St\xf6rungen","Register {r}, Bit {b}","DEMO","Im Demo-Modus ausprobieren","Demo verlassen","Erfundene Daten, kein Ger\xe4t verbunden. Sie zeigen nur, wie die App aussieht: es sind keine Messwerte deiner Maschine.","Passive \xdcberwachung der W\xe4rmepumpe","Adresse des Ger\xe4ts","Verbinden","Verbinde...",'Keine Antwort von "{h}".',"Das Ger\xe4t muss im selben WLAN sein. Hat es sich nicht ins Netz eingebucht, \xf6ffnet es einen Access Point namens ECOTWIN_Sniffer, erreichbar unter 192.168.4.1.","Ger\xe4t mit dem Heimnetz verbinden","Gefundene Netze","Suche l\xe4uft\u2026","kein Netz gefunden","Suche fehlgeschlagen","Erneut suchen","Netzwerkname","Passwort","Verbinden und neu starten","Der Netzwerkname wird ben\xf6tigt.","Speichern\u2026","Gespeichert. Das Ger\xe4t startet neu und versucht sich zu verbinden. Stimmt das Netz, ist es wieder unter ecotwin.local erreichbar.","Speichern fehlgeschlagen.","Das Ger\xe4t startet neu.","Nach dem Neustart verschwindet das Ger\xe4t aus diesem Netz und meldet sich im Heimnetz als ecotwin.local. Der Bus-Sniffer l\xe4uft auch ohne WLAN weiter: die Netzwerkkonfiguration h\xe4lt ihn nie an.","Aktuelle Betriebsart","Zugriffsebene","Softwareversion","Datenbankversion","EEPROM-Version","Softwareversion Au\xdfeneinheit","Vorlauf","R\xfccklauf","Innenw\xe4rmetauscher","Warmwasser","Heiz-/K\xfchlwasser","Mischventil 1","Mischventil 2","Betriebsart","Verdichterfrequenz","\xd6ffnung Expansionsventil","Au\xdfentemperatur","Au\xdfen, Mittel 1 h","Au\xdfen, Mittel 4 h","Au\xdfen, Mittel 24 h","Hochdruck","Niederdruck","Hei\xdfgastemperatur","Sauggastemperatur","Au\xdfenw\xe4rmetauscher","L\xfcfter 1","L\xfcfter 2","Stromaufnahme","Netzspannung","Abtauung aktiv","Raumtemperatur","Str\xf6mungsw\xe4chter","EVU-Sperre","Externes Signal K\xfchlen","Externes Signal Heizen","Anforderung hohe Temperatur","PWM-Signal","0-10-V-Signal 1","0-10-V-Signal 2","St\xf6rungen 1","St\xf6rungen 2","St\xf6rungen 3","St\xf6rungen 4","St\xf6rungen 5 (Umrichter)","St\xf6rungen 6 (Umrichter)","St\xf6rungen 7 (PFC)","Momentanleistung","Angeforderte Leistung","Volumenstrom","W\xe4rmeleistung","COP","Hydraulikkreis","Hydraulikmodul","3-Wege","Warmwasserspeicher","Whg. 1","Whg. 2","Netz","Mischer","Umw\xe4lzpumpe","Etage 1","Etage 2","Heizkreis umbenennen","WW","Vorlauf hei\xdf","gemischt zur Fu\xdfbodenheizung","R\xfccklauf und Kaltwasser","Bildet die beschriebene Anlage ab: ein einziger gemischter Kreis, der sich auf die zwei Etagen verzweigt, nicht zwei getrennte Kreise wie in der Zeichnung des Bedienteils. Mit dem 3-Wege-Umschaltventil laufen Warmwasser und Heizung nie gleichzeitig: die Maschine macht das eine oder das andere.","Noch zu best\xe4tigen: ob der Mischer von der Maschine angesteuert wird, und ob der Kreis Tv1 und nicht Tv2 ist. Hat der Mischer einen eigenen Thermostatkopf, kennt die Maschine dessen Temperatur nicht und die Anzeige geh\xf6rt entfernt. Ein Pufferspeicher ist nicht vorhanden: best\xe4tigt.","Warmwasser","Heizen","K\xfchlen","Warmwasser aktiv","Heizen aktiv","K\xfchlen aktiv","Zeitprogramm aktiv","Schutz Hauptleitungsstrom","Schutz Verdichter-Phasenstrom","IPM-Modulschutz","Schutz Verdichter-\xd6lr\xfcckf\xfchrung","Schutz Hochdruckschalter","Verdichterdrehzahl reduziert wegen Hochdruck","Schutz Vorw\xe4rmung beim ersten Start","F\xfchlerfehler Hei\xdfgas au\xdfen","F\xfchlerfehler Au\xdfenverdampfer","Schutz Netzspannung zu hoch oder zu niedrig","St\xf6rung durch Au\xdfentemperatur","Frequenzbegrenzung wegen Au\xdfentemperatur","Schutz Niederdruckschalter",u.r,"Kommunikation Au\xdfenplatine - Verdichterumrichter unterbrochen","Schutz Verdichterphase (offen oder kurzgeschlossen)","Verdichterstrom zu hoch","St\xf6rung Verdichterumrichter","St\xf6rung Gleichspannungsversorgung des Umrichters","St\xf6rung Wechselstrom","EEPROM-St\xf6rung","F\xfchlerfehler Au\xdfentemperatur","F\xfchlerfehler Au\xdfenw\xe4rmetauscher","F\xfchlerfehler Hei\xdfgas","F\xfchlerfehler Sauggas","St\xf6rung Niederdrucksensor","St\xf6rung Hochdrucksensor","St\xf6rung Hochdruckschalter","St\xf6rung Str\xf6mungsw\xe4chter","St\xf6rung DC-L\xfcfter A","St\xf6rung DC-L\xfcfter B","St\xf6rung Verdampfungsdruck","Hochdruckst\xf6rung","F\xfchlerfehler Raumtemperatur","F\xfchlerfehler Tw (Warmwasser)","F\xfchlerfehler Tc","F\xfchlerfehler Vorlauf","F\xfchlerfehler R\xfccklauf","F\xfchlerfehler Innenw\xe4rmetauscher","F\xfchlerfehler 3-Wege-Ventil 1","F\xfchlerfehler 3-Wege-Ventil 2",u.r,"EEPROM-St\xf6rung Innenplatine","St\xf6rung PWM-Signal","St\xf6rung 3-Wege-Ventil 1","St\xf6rung 3-Wege-Ventil 2","Frostschutz beim K\xfchlen (Innenw\xe4rmetauscher)","Schutz Str\xf6mungsw\xe4chter","St\xf6rung Str\xf6mungsw\xe4chter","Kommunikation mit Inneneinheit unterbrochen","Kommunikation mit Au\xdfeneinheit unterbrochen","Vorlauf zu kalt beim K\xfchlen","Vorlauf zu warm beim Heizen","Abtauung dreimal fehlgeschlagen","Vorlauf zu kalt beim Heizen oder Warmwasser","St\xf6rung Str\xf6mungsw\xe4chter dreimal","St\xf6rung W\xe4rmetauscher-Temperaturschutz","St\xf6rung Vorw\xe4rmung","St\xf6rung Wasserdurchfluss","IPM-\xdcberstrom","St\xf6rung Verdichterumrichter","Verdichter-\xdcberstrom","Phasenschutz der Eingangsspannung","St\xf6rung Stromerfassung","Abschaltung wegen \xdcberhitzung des Leistungsbauteils","St\xf6rung Vorladung","\xdcberspannung DC-Zwischenkreis","Unterspannung DC-Zwischenkreis","Unterspannung AC-Eingang","\xdcberstrom AC-Eingang","St\xf6rung Erfassung der Eingangsspannung","Kommunikation DSP - PFC unterbrochen","St\xf6rung Temperatursensor","Kommunikation DSP - Kommunikationsplatine unterbrochen","Gest\xf6rte Kommunikation mit der Hauptsteuerplatine","Alarm Verdichter-\xdcberstrom","Alarm Entmagnetisierungsschutz Verdichter","Alarm PIM-\xdcberhitzung","Alarm PFC-\xdcberhitzung","Alarm \xdcberstrom AC-Eingang","Abschaltung wegen IPM-\xdcberhitzung","Verdichter Phasenausfall","Verdichter-\xdcberlast","St\xf6rung Erfassung des Eingangsstroms","St\xf6rung PIM-Versorgungsspannung","St\xf6rung Spannung des Vorladekreises","EEPROM-St\xf6rung","St\xf6rung \xdcberspannung AC-Eingang","St\xf6rung Mikroelektronik","St\xf6rung Verdichter-Typcode","Hardware-\xdcberstrom bei der Stromerfassung","PFC-Hardware-\xdcberstrom","PFC-Software-\xdcberstrom","PFC-\xdcberspannung","St\xf6rung PFC-Temperatursensor","Abschaltung wegen PFC-\xdcberhitzung","reserviertes Bit","Anlagenparameter","Warmwasser","Temperatur","Wiedereinschalt-Differenz","Heizung","Heizkurve","Temperatur ohne Kurve","Freigegebene Betriebsarten","Warmwasser","Heizen","K\xfchlen","ein","aus","\xdcbernehmen","\xc4nderung best\xe4tigen?","{k}: von {p} auf {n}","Anfrage gesendet. Wartet auf eine Buspause und liest danach zur Best\xe4tigung zur\xfcck.","Die St\xfctzpunkte der Heizkurve sind \xfcber Modbus nicht schreibbar: sie werden am Bedienteil eingestellt. Hier l\xe4sst sich die Kurve nur ein- oder ausschalten.","Die K\xfchlung wird in dieser Anlage nicht genutzt und bleibt ausgeschaltet.","Diese \xc4nderungen werden in die Maschine geschrieben. Die Firmware akzeptiert nur acht Register und nur nach einer gemessenen Buspause, danach wird zur Best\xe4tigung zur\xfcckgelesen. Zwei Fehlschl\xe4ge hintereinander sperren die Funktion bis zum Neustart.","Schreiben nach zwei Fehlschl\xe4gen gesperrt. Erst entsperren, wenn die Ursache klar ist.","Entsperren","Letzte Schreibvorg\xe4nge","Bisher keine Schreibvorg\xe4nge.","Abtauung l\xe4uft: sp\xe4ter erneut versuchen.","Es liegt eine aktive St\xf6rung vor: zuerst beheben.","Anfrage vom Ger\xe4t abgelehnt.","Demo-Modus: es wird nichts an die Maschine geschrieben.","Aus der Ferne ist das Schreiben nicht erlaubt: daf\xfcr im lokalen Netz sein.","auf 8 Register begrenzt","Fernzugriff","Aktivieren","Host","Port","Benutzer","Passwort","Topic-Pr\xe4fix","Speichern","Das Ger\xe4t verbindet sich ausgehend mit einem MQTT-Broker (z. B. HiveMQ Cloud): keine Portfreigabe beim Kunden n\xf6tig. Es sendet nur alle 60 Sekunden eine Zusammenfassung und sofort einen Hinweis bei einer neuen St\xf6rung \u2014 nie die rohen Bus-Telegramme.","REMOTE","Auf Remote wechseln","Zur\xfcck zu lokal"],t.li)
B.Mw=new A.bn(B.l9,["ecotwin.local or 192.168.188.x","Status","Data","Bus","Registers","Config","System OK","Fault","Bus silent","Waiting","Waiting for data","No frame received","No frame received from the bus yet","{n} frames read, bus active","{n} active alarms","1 active alarm","The heat pump reports a fault","Bus silent for {t}","Possible fault, or the cable came loose","Check A/B, transceiver supply and RO on GPIO16","Device unreachable","Check that it is powered and on the same network","GS hydraulic module \xb7 R410A","Flow","Return","Hot water","Outdoor","24 h average {v}","Refrigerant circuit","Mirrors the panel's Info screen (manual ch. 4.2): same layout, same labels, same components. Values come from the registers read on the bus.","Ambient","Fan 1","Fan 2","Standby","Heating","Cooling","on","off","Compressor","Frequency","Expansion valve","Defrost","Heat output","COP","Diagnostics","Evaporating","Condensing","Superheat","Subcooling","Water \u0394T","Expected at these conditions","Efficiency ratio","Refrigerant charge","Charge plausibly correct","Possibly undercharged","Possibly overcharged","Inconclusive picture","good efficiency","average efficiency","low efficiency","partial","not assessable","Waiting for operating data.","Compressor stopped: nothing to assess.","Defrost in progress: readings are not meaningful.","Assessment only available in heating. In cooling the liquid line is on the other side of the circuit.","Indications, not a diagnosis. Valid only with the machine settled for a few minutes. Thresholds are generic for R410A, not from this machine's manual, and pressures are read as absolute bar: an assumption still to be verified. If the picture suggests an abnormal charge, have it measured by a technician: it is not proof of a leak.","Label legend","water outlet, flow","water inlet, return","liquid line","suction pressure, low side","suction temperature","discharge pressure, high side","compressor discharge","outdoor coil","expansion valve opening","outdoor air","fan speed","compressor frequency and current","The labels are the panel's own. The two marked with ? are assumed mappings, not yet verified on the bus.","Waiting for the operating registers.\nThe sniffer only sees them when the panel polls them.","Temperatures","Circuit","Electrical","Performance","Versions","Frames","{n} bytes","CRC errors","{n} valid","Bus silence","Uptime","Slaves on the bus","No slave seen on the bus.","Raw frames","No frame captured.","Addr","Req.","Resp.","Exc.","Reg.","Age","Address {n}","request","response","exception","write","bad CRC","Index \u2192 register mapping","Analysis not available yet.","Per the manufacturer's protocol a parameter's register is the database index plus one, so offset 1, flat model is expected here. If anything else comes out, the machine does not follow that document and the machine is to be believed.","Too few registers for a reliable comparison.","Offset recognised: {off} ({modello}). Register of parameter N = {off} + N.","No convincing offset: more registers are needed, or the mapping does not follow the document.","flat model","variable width","Registers","Changing only","Refresh","No register for this slave.","Slave {n}","{n} registers","Reg","Par.","Val","Min","Max","Offset","Model","Score","of","Device","Firmware","IP address","WiFi","Free memory","Uptime","Network","Connected network","Mode","access point","home network","Change network","Restart","Credentials live in the chip's non-volatile memory and survive firmware updates. If the network does not answer at boot, the device opens the ECOTWIN_Sniffer access point and the sniffer keeps running anyway.","RS485 bus","Settings","Transmission","disabled","RX pin","TX pin","none",'The device transmits only to write the eight parameters in the card above, only on explicit request and only after a measured gap on the bus: see "System parameters". For everything else it stays receive-only. If every frame arrives with a bad CRC, the first thing to try is 8N1.',"Connection","Change device address","Maintenance","Clear collected data","Clears the register table, the statistics and the frame log on the device. It does not touch the configuration and does not write to the bus.","Language","Clear the data?","Registers, statistics and frames collected so far are deleted from the device. The operation cannot be undone.","Restart the device?","The sniffer starts over: the statistics collected so far are lost. The bus is not touched.","Cancel","Data cleared","Clearing failed","Active alarms","register {r}, bit {b}","DEMO","Try in demo mode","Exit demo","Made-up data, no device connected. They only show how the app looks: these are not readings from your machine.","Passive heat pump monitoring","Device address","Connect","Connecting...",'No answer from "{h}".',"The device must be on the same WiFi network. If it did not join the network it opens an access point called ECOTWIN_Sniffer, reachable at 192.168.4.1.","Connect the device to your home network","Networks found","scanning\u2026","no network found","scan failed","Scan again","Network name","Password","Connect and restart","The network name is required.","Saving\u2026","Saved. The device restarts and tries to connect. If the network is right, find it again at ecotwin.local.","Saving failed.","The device is restarting.","After the restart the device leaves this network and appears on the home network as ecotwin.local. The bus sniffer keeps working without WiFi too: network configuration never stops it.","Current working mode","Access level","Software version","Database version","EEPROM version","Outdoor unit software version","Flow","Return","Indoor coil","Domestic hot water","Heating/cooling water","Mixing valve 1","Mixing valve 2","Operating mode","Compressor frequency","Expansion valve opening","Outdoor temperature","Outdoor, 1 h average","Outdoor, 4 h average","Outdoor, 24 h average","High pressure","Low pressure","Compressor discharge","Compressor suction","Outdoor coil","Fan 1","Fan 2","Current draw","Supply voltage","Defrost active","Room temperature","Flow switch","Utility lock","External cooling signal","External heating signal","High temperature demand","PWM signal","0-10 V signal 1","0-10 V signal 2","Alarms 1","Alarms 2","Alarms 3","Alarms 4","Alarms 5 (drive)","Alarms 6 (drive)","Alarms 7 (PFC)","Instantaneous power","Demanded power","Flow rate","Heat output","COP","Hydraulic circuit","hydraulic module","3-way","DHW tank","Flat 1","Flat 2","mains","mixing valve","booster pump","floor 1","floor 2","Rename the circuit","DHW","hot flow","mixed to underfloor","return and cold water","Reflects the described system: a single mixed circuit branching to the two floors, not two separate circuits as in the panel's drawing. With the 3-way diverting valve, hot water and heating never run together: the machine does one or the other.","Still to confirm: whether the mixing valve is machine-controlled, and whether the circuit is Tv1 rather than Tv2. If the mixing valve has its own thermostatic head, the machine does not know its temperature and that label should be removed. There is no buffer tank: confirmed.","DHW","heating","cooling","DHW in process","heating in process","cooling in process","timer in process","Main line current protection","Compressor phase current protection","IPM module protection","Compressor oil return protection","High Pressure switch protection","Compressor speed down caused by too high pressure detected by pressure sensor","1st start pre-heat protection","Outdoor gas discharge temp.sensor protection","Outdoor evaporator coil temp.sensor protection","AC high/low voltage protection","Failure caused by ambient Temp.","Frequency limit protection by ambient Temp.","Low pressure switch protection",u.H,"Communication failure between outdoor PCB and compressor driver","Compressor phase protection (open or short-circuit)","Compressor working current failure (too high)","Compressor driver failure","Compressor driver VDC supply voltage failure","AC current failure","EEPROM failure","Ambient temp sensor failure","Outdoor coil temp sensor failure","Compressor discharge temp sensor failure","Compressor suction temp sensor failure","Low pressure sensor failure","High pressure sensor failure","High pressure switch failure","Flow switch failure","DC fan motor A failure","DC fan motor B failure","Evaporating pressure failure","High pressure failure","Room temp sensor failure","Tw sensor failure","Tc sensor failure","Water outlet sensor failure","Water inlet sensor failure","Indoor coil sensor failure","3-way valve 1 sensor failure","3-way valve 2 sensor failure",u.H,"Indoor EEPROM failure","PWM signal failure","3-way valve 1 failure","3-way valve 2 failure","Cooling anti-freezing protection (indoor coil temp)","Flow switch protection","Flow switch failure","Indoor communication failure","Outdoor communication failure","Water outlet temp too low in cooling","Water outlet temp too high in heating","Defrost failure (3 times)","Water outlet temp too low in heating/DHW","Flow switch failure (3 times)","Coil temp protection failure","Preheating failure","Water flow fault","IPM over current","Compressor drive failure","Compressor over current","Input voltage phase protection","Current sampling fault","Power component overheating shutdown","Pre-charge failure","DC bus over-voltage","DC bus undervoltage","AC input undervoltage","AC input overcurrent","Input voltage sampling fault","DSP and PFC communication fault, only for single-phase series drive","Temperature sensor failure",'DSP and communication board communication failure"',"abnormal communication with main control board","Compressor overcurrent alarm","Compressor weak magnetic protection alarm","PIM overheat alarm","PFC overheat alarm","AC input overcurrent alarm, only for single-phase series drives","IPM module overheat shutdown, only for 3-phase 5~6P drives","Compressor out of phase","Compressor overload","Input current sampling fault","PIM supply voltage fault","Precharge circuit voltage fault","EEPROM fault","AC input overvoltage fault","Microelectronics fault","Compressor type code fault","Current sampling signal overcurrent (hardware overcurrent)","PFC hardware overcurrent","PFC software overcurrent","PFC overvoltage","PFC temperature sensor fault","PFC overheat shutdown","reserved bit","System parameters","Domestic hot water","Temperature","Restart differential","Heating","Heating curve","Temperature without curve","Enabled modes","Hot water","Heating","Cooling","on","off","Apply","Confirm the change?","{k}: from {p} to {n}","Request sent. Waits for a gap on the bus, then reads back to confirm.","The heating curve points are not writable over Modbus: they are set on the panel. Here the curve can only be switched on or off.","Cooling is not used in this system and is kept off.","These changes are written to the machine. The firmware accepts only eight registers and only after a measured gap on the bus, then reads back to confirm. Two consecutive failures lock the function until restart.","Writing locked after two failures. Only unlock once the cause is understood.","Unlock","Recent writes","No writes so far.","Defrost in progress: try again later.","There is an active alarm: resolve it first.","Request rejected by the device.","Demo mode: nothing is written to the machine.","Writing is not allowed remotely: you must be on the local network.","limited to 8 registers","Remote access","Enable","Host","Port","Username","Password","Topic prefix","Save","The device connects outbound to an MQTT broker (e.g. HiveMQ Cloud): no port needs opening at the customer's home. It only sends a summary every 60 seconds and an immediate notice when an alarm changes \u2014 never the raw bus frames.","REMOTE","Switch to remote","Switch to local"],t.li)
